# Spec for tools/riscpkg.py: OpenTTD-OpenSFX.
Package: OpenTTD-OpenSFX
Section: Games
Priority: Optional
Licence: Free
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 0.4.0
Environment: any
Depends: OpenTTD
Homepage: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-openttd
Description: Sound effects for OpenTTD (OpenSFX)
 The free OpenSFX sound set for OpenTTD. It goes into OpenTTD's
 baseset directory.
Build-Map: !OpenTTD/baseset/opensfx -> Apps/Games/!OpenTTD/baseset/opensfx
